<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>i don't forgive you</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Isabel LaRosa</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">YOU FEAR THE GOD THAT LOVES YOU</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6D2HY29PYcdXCicrs55Icx</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">10 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Translations</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Français</p><p ttm:agent="v1">i don’t forgive you Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I don't forgive you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I don't forgive you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, is she really everything you need?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's crazy, think you love her after just two weeks</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You hate me 'cause you know I'm not that easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I hope she breaks your heart so casually</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't forgive you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't forgive you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I still fuckin' miss you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I don't forgive you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Trust me, I'm in every other girl you'll meet</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You'll see that God'll bring you back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, I hope you think she'll never leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And then she breaks your heart so casually</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't forgive you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't forgive you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I still fuckin' miss you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I don't forgive you[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You drive away, I guess today's the last time I see your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't forgive you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't forgive you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I still fuckin' miss you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I don't forgive you</p></div></body></tt>